WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.463
Week 13: City, Directions, and Public Services. ask for and give directions identify public services confirm a route

2
00:00:08.463 --> 00:00:15.113
Mission brief. Guide a visitor from a transit stop to three services and recover from a wrong turn.

3
00:00:15.113 --> 00:00:24.497
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:24.497 --> 00:00:32.192
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:32.192 --> 00:00:40.634
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:40.634 --> 00:01:07.767
Model language. Voy a guiar a un visitante desde la parada. — I am going to guide a visitor from the stop. Lo llevo a tres servicios diferentes. — I take them to three different services. Si me equivoco, corrijo el giro. — If I make a mistake, I correct the turn. Confirmo la ruta con el mapa. — I confirm the route with the map. Me recupero rápido de un error. — I recover quickly from an error.

7
00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:17.515
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
